<title>USA: IPO FILING - Brilliant Digital Entertainment Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Brilliant Digital Entertainment Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Brilliant Digital Entertainment Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			BRIL.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $11.50-$13.50/shr</p>
<p>Common shares to be offered   2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  none</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after IPO    7,200,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    CS First Boston</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  300,000 shrs Business: Woodland Hills, Calif.,-based company was launched to create digital entertainment to be distributed over the Internet, on CD-ROM as TV programming and for home video. Use of Proceeds: For the production of its Multipath Movies, which are three dimensional, digitally animated stories, development of a new production studio, enhancement of software tools, acquisition of licenses, repayment of debt and for other generalcorporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data for fiscal year ended June 30:</p>
<p>				  1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		$2,053,877	 $842,796</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $553,412	 $423,853</p>
